    LLM: "Lead low combinations to force opponents to use high cards; save bombs (three- or four-of-a-kind) to regain the lead when needed.\n\nCount cards and track which combinations have been played; time your passes to let others burn high cards.\n\nAs declarer, open with combinations that split opponents; as opponents, coordinate to exhaust declarer's bombs before going out.",
